            <p>Semantic structures, bodies, and field particles in one shared, platform-native runtime.</p>
            <footer class="card-footer">
              <span class="citation-link">Cites: Spec 02</span>
              <span class="signal-metric" data-metric="pub-1">d: 0.00</span>
            </footer>
          </article>

