        </header>
        <div class="well-cards-list">
          <article 
            id="pub-4" 
            class="relational-pub-card" 
            data-body="attract" 
            data-strength="0.6" 
            data-range="220" 
            data-feedback 
            data-field-relation="cites" 
            data-field-target="#pub-2"
            data-category="guide"
            style="--cat-accent: #2dd4bf;"
            tabindex="0"
          >
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="pub-tag">Guide</span>
              <time class="pub-date">2026-08-05</time>
            </div>
            <h3>04. Platform Host Seam Architecture</h3>
            <p>Host adapters binding zero-dep core models across DOM, Three.js, and native platforms.</p>
            <footer class="card-footer">
              <span class="citation-link">Cites: Spec 02</span>
              <span class="signal-metric" data-metric="pub-4">d: 0.00</span>
            </footer>
          </article>

          <article 
            id="pub-6" 
            class="relational-pub-card" 
            data-body="attract" 
            data-strength="0.6" 
            data-range="220" 
            data-feedback 
            data-field-relation="cites" 
            data-field-target="#pub-3"
            data-category="guide"
            style="--cat-accent: #2dd4bf;"
            tabindex="0"
          >
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="pub-tag">Guide</span>
              <time class="pub-date">2026-08-12</time>
            </div>
            <h3>06. Host ⇄ Field Runtime Mechanics</h3>
            <p>Two-way host integration loops for continuous layout-to-topology transitions.</p>
            <footer class="card-footer">
              <span class="citation-link">Cites: Paper 03</span>
              <span class="signal-metric" data-metric="pub-6">d: 0.00</span>
            </footer>
